 ```
 
+### Live trajectory map
+
+The panel below the camera shows the start, travelled route, and current heading
+from MuJoCo poses, independently of the VLN server. Manual and autonomous motion
+both update it. STOP preserves the route; RESET starts a new map. Reloading the
+page restores the server's history.
+
+The standalone [trajectory_map package](../trajectory_map/README.md) contains the
+recorder, browser component, tests, and future ROS EKF/Habitat input contract.
+`uv` installs it from the sibling `../trajectory_map` directory, so keep that
+directory when copying this demo. This first version uses simulator ground truth,
+not odometry/IMU fusion, and does not require lidar or special topology nodes.
+
 ### MicroDuck (optional)
 
 MicroDuck support deliberately keeps the robot MJCF, meshes, and walking policy
